      "id": "claim_11311cfea0754b919a14b076d6fb3981",
      "statement": "The NII Sensitivity model applies instantaneous parallel shocks to a static balance sheet with deposit betas of 0.45 (consumer) and 0.75 (wholesale); at Dec 31, 2025 base 12-month NII is $50,237 million and +/-100 bp and +/-200 bp shocks change NII by +/-$1,508 million (3.0%) and +/-$3,017 million (6.0%), inside a 7.0% Board decline limit; the base figure corresponds to the 2026 NII outlook rather than 2025 reported NII of $48,620 million.",
